# Play test of Firedance Isle (CIPlay firedance_isle, in a test world 'CI ...'). No quest: the huts and their box and
# chest, up the path to the holy place and the offerings, the south cave's chest, the boars. Points as in its recipe.
island Firedance Isle
offset 0 0
expect animals Warthog 3
expect animals Turtle 2
wait 3
kill Warthog
# Into the big hut (north of the fire), its chest
walk -6.75 -8 to -6.75 -6 to -6.75 -3.5 h=3.1 below=5
open Chest in the big hut
# Into a hut south of the fire, its box
walk -12 -17 to -12 -19 to -12 -21.5 h=3.1 below=5
open Box in the hut
# Up the path to the holy place, the offerings before the altar
walk -4 -4 to -1.5 -0.5 to 2 2.5 to 6 7 to 12 9 h=11
open Offerings on the altar
# Into the south cave
walk 21 -10 to 21 -16 to 21 -20 h=2.1 below=3
open Chest in the south cave
dig
